---
id: exp-template-and-use
title: Template and use contract
date: 2026-05-19
primary_reaction: rxn-main
primary_result: res-main
---

:::chemd #mol-start
kind: molecule
name: ketone
smiles: CC(=O)C
:::

:::chemd #mol-product
kind: molecule
name: alcohol
smiles: CC(O)C
:::

:::chemd #rxn-main
kind: reaction
reactants: @mol-start
products: @mol-product
reagents: NaBH4
solvent: MeOH
temperature: 25 C
time: 1 h
:::

:::result #res-main
reaction: rxn-main
product: mol-product
status: success
yield: 88 %
:::

:::template reaction-note
params:
  - rxn: ref<reaction>
  - result: ref<result>
  - label: string
  - target: quantity<temperature>
bind: reaction=rxn-main
description: reusable reaction note

Template @param.label resolves @param.rxn and @param.result at @param.target.
Bound reaction solvent is @reaction.solvent.
:::

:::use reaction-note
rxn: rxn-main
result: res-main
label: main reduction
target: 25 C
:::
